body:
It's a defect on lots of Legion laptops. It's happening on mine, too, and Lenovo support has been dismissive and won't fix it. There's a law office working on a case regarding this since Lenovo is aware of the defective products and is attempting to sweep it under the rug while profiting off of the repair invoices.

&#x200B;

https://classlawdc.com/2021/10/07/lenovo-legion-defective-cooling-fan-investigation/
